{"name": "Clackwork", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set it up. Tap. Clack.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is a small white board with a Start piece and a green End piece. Drag your dominoes onto the board, turn the ones that need turning, tap the start and watch the chain run. If it knocks over the End, you win.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/5d16e98ee42c9cd5bb3465e64d8e62e7.poster.avif?t=1794567231\" width=\"752\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/5d16e98ee42c9cd5bb3465e64d8e62e7.webm?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/5d16e98ee42c9cd5bb3465e64d8e62e7.mp4?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are never enough plain dominoes for the long way round, so the puzzle is using the special ones well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">17 special dominoes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corners turn the chain. Splitters send it left and right. Talls reach over gaps, Skaters slide until something stops them, Bombs knock over all four sides, Walkie-Talkies fall together, and a Rewind stands everything back up for one more run. The board has its own pieces too: Doors, Beat Gates, Twin Blocks, and Vases you must not touch.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/fd2ca93d18191c3ea9f8274bb775adf0.poster.avif?t=1794567231\" width=\"752\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/fd2ca93d18191c3ea9f8274bb775adf0.webm?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/fd2ca93d18191c3ea9f8274bb775adf0.mp4?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"482\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/14dfaed5a872cd2a0e7762d1e4bc93f0.poster.avif?t=1794567231\" width=\"752\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/14dfaed5a872cd2a0e7762d1e4bc93f0.webm?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/14dfaed5a872cd2a0e7762d1e4bc93f0.mp4?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One new idea at a time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first ten levels teach the basics. After that, each new domino gets a few levels of its own before it gets mixed in with the others, and the last levels mix them all.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"572\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/da1879e4eb20375a929c88d7931d9eb5.poster.avif?t=1794567231\" width=\"752\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/da1879e4eb20375a929c88d7931d9eb5.webm?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/da1879e4eb20375a929c88d7931d9eb5.mp4?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 hand-made levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A star on 40 levels for winning with as few pieces as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No physics wobble: the chain runs in steady ticks, so the same layout always ends the same way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Undo, restart and a piece guide whenever you want them. No timers, no lives</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"424\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/32444ac42eab414d499e05aae61df567.poster.avif?t=1794567231\" width=\"752\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/32444ac42eab414d499e05aae61df567.webm?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/extras/32444ac42eab414d499e05aae61df567.mp4?t=1794567231\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clean and quiet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chunky cel-shaded pieces with soft shadows on a white board, and a satisfying little clack for every domino that falls.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Place dominoes on a small white board, tap the start and watch the chain race to the green End piece. 50 puzzles and 17 special dominoes that turn, hop, slide, split, explode and rewind. Use as few pieces as you can to earn a star.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5585570/c22b86614973ebef1761062ffa81ac8b9b1d4963/header.jpg?t=1794567231", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Puzzle", "3D", "Abstract", "Cartoony", "Colorful"], "developers": "PlayMirasia", "publishers": "PlayMirasia", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5585570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/sCrc4-iI8hk", "first_seen": 1795129200.0, "review_rank": 19}